  "recruit_walks": {
    "source": "DEC-25 (a unit queued into an empty queue in tick t gets its first tick of progress in t and appears in t + unit_ticks - 1; the next one starts in the next tick) and DEC-48, item H3 with rows RP1 and RP9 (a recruit of a city with a rally point leaves the tick after it appears and pays recruit.rally_cost then, or with fewer CP gets no order). No CP income. The map of the worked examples of mechanics.md, section 5 (dec48): the capital H with its point at R, set before the queue. `at`: the tick of the snapshot; `view`: what it shows of H (`pending`: units made and not gone yet) and the own CP; `walks[i].after`: the ticks after `at` the walk leaves.",
